    "Unobserved declarations are never classified unused; macro-only, uncached, reflective, symbolic-name, CI and runtime roots remain incomplete.",
    "Provenance labels classify pinned source paths/markers; untraced and unresolved chain/agreement code is not certified handwritten.",
    "Output files are replaced individually; interruption can leave unvalidated output. Rerun --check, or regenerate on failure, before using results.",
    "Cached bytes are externally trusted; source, producers, commands, toolchain and input/output digests are validated under the writer lease."
